  "atomic_questions": [
    "In the production plan, are you requiring that each week's demand for foods I and II be met exactly on time (no late delivery allowed), or are you allowing some demand to be delivered late and paying the stated compensation fees for the late kg?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response presents a single binary choice regarding the policy for meeting demand (on-time vs. late with penalty), which constitutes one semantically independent clarification question."
}

